completed_at: "2026-08-27T17:34:29.187Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Golden transcript corpus (canonical agent task sequences) versioned in-repo; replay runner reports bytes+approx-tokens per completed task against the current build; wired into the existing token-cost CI gate lineage with a documented regression threshold; boundary with pm-atfm quality harness documented; workflow for adding transcripts documented
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: completed
expected_result: Versioned golden agent workflows are replayed against current CLI transports and enforce per-step and completed-task token ceilings.
actual_result: "A public SDK parser and mandatory four-task, eleven-step replay gate now enforce envelope completeness, recovery, mutation, transport accounting, corpus identity, and a 3,935-token composite baseline."
